+
+# Request
+
+Implement JSON Patch (RFC 6902) with its six operations (add, remove, replace, move, copy, test).
+Export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`: returns a new document, never mutates its
+input, throws when the patch is invalid or an operation fails.
+
+# Done
+
+- `applyPatch` in `src/index.ts`, reusing the RFC 6901 pointer parsing (`parsePointer`).
+- Works on a deep copy, so it is atomic and the input and patch are untouched; `__proto__` members are
+  handled without prototype pollution.
+- Tests in `test/patch.test.ts`; documented in `README.md`.
